{"q":"50","t":"Pow(x, n)","d":"Medium","p":false,"c":"<p>Implement <a href=\"http://www.cplusplus.com/reference/valarray/pow/\" target=\"_blank\">pow(x, n)</a>, which calculates <code>x</code> raised to the power <code>n</code> (i.e., <code>x<sup>n</sup></code>).</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 1:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> x = 2.00000, n = 10\n<strong>Output:</strong> 1024.00000\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 2:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> x = 2.10000, n = 3\n<strong>Output:</strong> 9.26100\n</pre>\n\n<p><strong class=\"example\">Example 3:</strong></p>\n\n<pre>\n<strong>Input:</strong> x = 2.00000, n = -2\n<strong>Output:</strong> 0.25000\n<strong>Explanation:</strong> 2<sup>-2</sup> = 1/2<sup>2</sup> = 1/4 = 0.25\n</pre>\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n\n<ul>\n\t<li><code>-100.0 &lt; x &lt; 100.0</code></li>\n\t<li><code>-2<sup>31</sup> &lt;= n &lt;= 2<sup>31</sup>-1</code></li>\n\t<li><code>n</code> is an integer.</li>\n\t<li>Either <code>x</code> is not zero or <code>n &gt; 0</code>.</li>\n\t<li><code>-10<sup>4</sup> &lt;= x<sup>n</sup> &lt;= 10<sup>4</sup></code></li>\n</ul>\n","h":[],"m":"{\r\n  \"name\": \"myPow\",\r\n  \"params\": [\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"x\",\r\n      \"type\": \"double\"\r\n    },\r\n    {\r\n      \"name\": \"n\",\r\n      \"type\": \"integer\"\r\n    }\r\n  ],\r\n  \"return\": {\r\n    \"type\": \"double\"\r\n  }\r\n}","g":[{"name":"Math","slug":"math"},{"name":"Recursion","slug":"recursion"}],"s":[{"t":"Sqrt(x)","s":"sqrtx","d":"Easy","p":false},{"t":"Super Pow","s":"super-pow","d":"Medium","p":false},{"t":"Count Collisions of Monkeys on a Polygon","s":"count-collisions-of-monkeys-on-a-polygon","d":"Medium","p":false}],"co":[["Meta","facebook"],["Google","google"],["Bloomberg","bloomberg"],["Amazon","amazon"],["Microsoft","microsoft"],["LinkedIn","linkedin"],["Nvidia","nvidia"],["Infosys","infosys"],["eBay","ebay"],["Oracle","oracle"],["Citadel","citadel"],["Walmart Labs","walmart-labs"],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs"],["tcs","tcs"],["ServiceNow","servicenow"],["Wix","wix"]],"cs":{"a":[["Google","google",14],["Amazon","amazon",5],["Bloomberg","bloomberg",3],["Microsoft","microsoft",2]],"b":[["Meta","facebook",12],["tcs","tcs",2]],"m":[["LinkedIn","linkedin",22],["eBay","ebay",5],["Goldman Sachs","goldman-sachs",4],["Oracle","oracle",3],["Adobe","adobe",2],["Walmart Labs","walmart-labs",2],["EPAM Systems","epam-systems",2],["TikTok","tiktok",2],["Cisco","cisco",2],["Citadel","citadel",2]]}}